  "pieces": [
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a5d8c954a37f20073ff929b",
      "background": "#191919",
      "content": "<aa href=\"83,49,99\"><video src=\"https://codex-content.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/images/1516080245016-turtle.mp4\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" autoplay loop muted /></a>",
      "created": "2018-01-16T05:24:37.668Z",
      "fullWidth": true,
      "lovers": null,
      "page": 94,
      "parent": {
        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "5a0fe283d55a8200722c03d8",
        "background": "",
        "content": "<div style=\"color:#3d3e3d\">\n    <p>\n        Turtles are under water, and<br/>\n        some turtle is punctured right through by a line.<br/>\n        The line had gone through through the turtle colony. <br/>\n        This turtle moved <aa href=\"67\">on the line</aa>, as if hosting an intestine,<br/>\n        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;as if moving left when the line moved left. <br/>\n        It could see an independent turtle on another intestine <br/>\n        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;and spiralled regularly around it. \n     </p>\n     <p>\n        We are we, and <br/>\n        we think of water as moving on a 3D conveyor belt, and<br/>\n        we think of turtles underwater as entangled with us priorly, and<br/>\n        we think of Hermes as an entangled line and a turtle, and<br/>\n        we think of fibrous light as an opening.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        <aa href=\"115\">I am yours</aa>, and <br/>\n        the body part of the turtle urges itself around the line.<br/>\n        This roulette of turtles spirals around us syntotically now.<br/>\n        Intraction swings under water into info.<br/>\n        We tell turtles what to do.<br/>\n        We spill our guts.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "created": "2017-11-18T07:34:27.801Z",
        "fullWidth": false,
        "lovers": [
          "59a388d7d9eba100763a0f55"
        ],
        "page": 83,
        "parent": "59a9696bec58b8007f5d501f",
        "persons": [
