          "5af8f4edeb5ad30054055e0c",
          "59a7a547a692ea00760b7970"
        ],
        "readme": "The aim of the Logo programming language was to help children imagine 'what they would do if they were the turtle'. (If only Logo were more informal; if only the turtles could meet.)",
